	(text "PHASE 4 - ASSEMBLY OPTION: FITTED ON PV-P100/110 ONLY"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 189.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "027e3a82-d047-518b-8394-2254e9fba0d8")
	)
	(text "TH_IL_HI/LO: IL window (+/-73 A); TH_OV: VA/VB 1084 V; TH_OTH: heatsink 87.9 C (PV-PWR: <= 89.9 C);\nTH_OTL: inductor 150 C; TH_OPEN 2.975 V: an NTC node above it is an open probe (cold limit -30 C)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 87.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "05e43c9f-0d00-5c12-8404-934a87239177")
	)
	(text "PHASES 1-3 AND THE PORT VOLTAGES (FITTED ON EVERY BUILD)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 100.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7cefcdb8-7afb-59b2-a893-74c1cf47a3ee")
	)
	(text "IL4 window, NTC4 / NTC8 over-temperature and open probe. Not fitted on PV-P75 (bom/PV-CTL-P75_BOM.csv),\nwhere IL4 = 0 V and NTC4 / NTC8 are open: nothing then pulls OC_N / OVT_N for phase 4. Fitted on a\n4-phase build, a dead IL4 sensor (0 V) or an open NTC4 / NTC8 trips (fail-safe). Firmware cross-checks."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 237.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d004cac8-3c89-53c7-b06b-98f089e14377")
	)
	(text "OC_N (wired-OR, 10k to +3V3): ILn_P above TH_IL_HI or below TH_IL_LO, n = 1-3. OVT_N (10k): VA, VB above\nTH_OV; NTC1-3 (heatsink) below TH_OTH, NTC5-7 (inductor) below TH_OTL; any of them above TH_OPEN.\nPort over-current (387-413 A) arrives on FLT_N from the power board's own comparators (PV-PWR)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 176.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f39722e1-16c7-5248-bf65-50e87bc55051")
	)
